# Basemap tiles. Leave all of these unset and the maps use Esri's keyless
# World Light Gray Canvas. CARTO's Positron CDN (the old hardcoded default)
# now stamps "API KEY REQUIRED" across every tile served without a key, so
# it only works once VITE_CARTO_API_KEY is filled in.
#   VITE_MAP_BASEMAP     carto | stadia | maptiler | esri | osm  (optional override)
#   VITE_CARTO_API_KEY   carto.com/basemaps/apikey
#   VITE_STADIA_API_KEY  client.stadiamaps.com  (alidade_smooth = Positron look)
#   VITE_MAPTILER_API_KEY  cloud.maptiler.com   (positron raster style)
